{{multiple images
|direction = vertical
|image1 = BMW, Techno Classica 2018, Essen (IMG 8951).jpg
|caption1 = The wheelhouse ''(sense 1.1)'' of a [[car]] is the [[partially]] [[enclosed#Adjective|enclosed]] structure above and around a [[wheel#Noun|wheel]]
