|caption2 = The wheelhouse ''(sense 1.2)'' of the ''[[:fr:Vieux Crabe|Vieux Crabe]]'', a [[sailboat]] [[moor#Verb|moored]] at {{w|Agde}} in [[Hérault]], [[Occitanie]], [[France]]
|image3 = Arthur Foss (tugboat), IMG17.jpg
|caption3 = The interior of the wheelhouse ''(sense 1.2)'' of the ''{{w|Arthur Foss}}'', thought to be the oldest [[wooden]] [[tugboat]] in the world still [[afloat]]. It is now [[preserve#Verb|preserved]] as a [[museum]] [[ship#Noun|ship]] in [[Seattle]], [[Washington]], USA.
