From {{compound|en|wheel|house}}. Sense 3 (“(''baseball'') a [[pitch#Noun|pitch]] [[location]] which is [[favourable]] to the [[hitter]]”) references the fact that a [[vessel]] is [[control#Verb|controlled]] from its wheelhouse ''(sense 1.2)'', and sense 4 (“a person’s [[area]] of [[authority]] or [[expertise]]”) is a figurative use of sense 2.<ref>Compare {{R:OED Online|entry=wheel-house|pos=n|id=228155|date=1923}}</ref>

